OxTree reimplements behaviour first written for QDirStat,
Copyright (C) 2015-2025 Stefan Hundhammer <Stefan.Hundhammer@gmx.de>,
also licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2.
No source files were copied; the following were carried over closely
enough to count as derived work:

- The squarified treemap layout and the cushion shading polynomial with
  QDirStat's constants (minimum tile size, ambient light, light vector,
  the ridge coefficient table), in crates/core/src/layout.rs and
  crates/core/src/cushion.rs. QDirStat in turn follows Bruls, Huizing
  and van Wijk, "Squarified Treemaps" (2000), and van Wijk and van de
  Wetering, "Cushion Treemaps" (1999).
- The default file category table (names, colours, suffixes and
  patterns), in crates/core/src/mime.rs.
- The standard cleanup actions, their placeholders and the configuration
  keys, in crates/core/src/cleanup.rs.
- The cache file format, versions 1.0 and 2.0, in crates/core/src/cache.rs.
- The default colours of the treemap and the percent bars, in
  crates/ui/src/theme.rs.
